WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:03.420
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome back to Subnautica.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.780
Now it is finally time *deep inhale* to do what must be done.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:11.640
It is a brand new day, and it is a brand new dawn.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.720
And with that comes... a new game.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:19.880
I'm not looking forward to this experience and I know you guys weren't either.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:25.140
In the past, I have told you guys that I have kept this save game for MONTHS.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:29.660
The same game I have been building on for MONTHS.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.180
Many multitudes of hours poured into one game.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:38.180
And I've upgraded over and over throughout every update that's come out,

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:42.760
hoping and praying that it would not blow up my game.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:49.720
And yet, with the most recent update--the machinery update--I can no longer keep my old game.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:56.260
I would be missing out on too much of the environment that they've built in since those updates came out.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:02.200
So with that said, I am going into this new game without any console commands.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:07.260
I will not be cheating, because in the end of the day, cheating kinda cheapens the experience of the entire game.

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:10.140
And it'll just ruin it for me, and it'll ruin the fun for everybody.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.980
So, I'm going to be diving back into this ocean...

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.080
Something something "symbolicism" about how this is gonna be.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.260
Blah blah blah here we go!

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:21.660
(mimicking souls of the damned) Ahhh, blefff!

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:22.600
So...

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:23.820
Welcome back.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:27.040
Now with this update, there's been a quite a number of things released.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:28.180
Number one...

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.620
