Oooh, I'm close to a, um...

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.540
I-I'm close to a, uh...

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:15.700
(Spit it out, man.)

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:19.340
Piece of the Aurora. I didn't even know I was this close to one.

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:20.440
Oooh.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:22.740
I bet... that this--

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.380
Oh, no, modification sta-- (sharp inhalation)

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:26.480
What was that?

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.160
Oh, I forgot about you!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.000
Urrgh!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.300
Oh, God, okay, y'know what? Forget that.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.920
Fuck you and fuck ever--AHHH HAH HAAA!

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.380
I just want the--fuck you!

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:37.200
AHHH!

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.020
AHH, fuck you!

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:42.880
Fuck you, man.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:47.840
Oh, God, I'm outta batteries!? Fuck my life!

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:50.100
(crying counter: 8)

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.880
All right, guys. Guess who's back.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.080
It is...

00:13:54.800 --> 00:14:00.060
My family, the only family I've ever known at the crack of dawn.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.600
(weird noise)

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:02.320
Hehe, it's--

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.900
