00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:12.120
This was supposed to be more climactic than this, but hang on just a second.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.020
BOOM!

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.020
Where are they?

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:15.180
There they are!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.620
Geoffrey, Billy, Samwise, and Ma-arshall?

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.520
Marshall was almost not there for a second. (Another dimension)

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:24.020
Geoffrey, Billy, Samwise, and Marshall, how have you been?

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:25.940
I know, I know...

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:27.940
Holy crap.

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.960
Why is this no working?

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:31.860
Uhhh...

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:33.700
Umm...

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:35.580
Uh...

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:41.820
I was under the assumption that there was s'posed to be a menu poppin' up at any moment there.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:42.880
*Boink* Umm...

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:44.780
We--

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:46.740
Uh, it--

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:47.900
(noises of confusion)

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:49.200
(more noises)

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:55.580
Maybe because I have absolutely no blueprints for it and I can't even make the SeaMoth.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.840
And I don't have that yet.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:00.340
But I'll get that, but the most important thing is it's a brand new day.

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:03.580
Geoffrey, Billy, Samwise, AND Marshall are back.

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:07.140
And I made a lot of progress; I've been playing for about an hour and a half here, but...

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:09.380
I've been doing okay...

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:13.340
Gettin' by, and we're gonna get there. In the next episode,

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:15.140
I will be MUCH farther along.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.500
I will explore much more things.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:20.800
And I will be ready to build a Cyclops.

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:24.360
Not just a SeaMoth; I'm gonna get the SeaMoth, and then I'm gonna build a Cyclops

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.680
for you at the start of the next episode.

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:28.560
Have lockers for names.

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:30.660
Thank you everybody so much for watching.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:34.320
It's a brand new game, which means brand new possibilities,

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:37.300
And we'll be ready for new updates!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.220
The ocean is a terrifying place, don't go there.

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:46.580
So thank you everybody again, and as always I will see YOU in the next video.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.320
